  "floatingAndroidBody": "Talk, mute, deafen and hang up over other apps. Needs the \"display over other apps\" permission.",
  "floatingIosBody": "Picture in Picture, appearing when you leave the app. The system allows three buttons: play/pause talks, skip back mutes, skip forward hangs up (twice to confirm).",
